  ('3c27d6f2-4419-53a0-8286-db64fa3e0ecf', 'LFA-CAP-SUB003-MERCH', 1, 'Core', 'L5', 5, 'High conscientiousness, moderate extraversion, collaborative agreeableness, steady emotional regulation, and openness to buyer or supplier feedback. This profile is especially important under buyer response, supplier follow-up, order accuracy, and shipment cut-off timing in polymeric footwear buyer, supplier, dispatch, and order handoff. Observable work demands: Closes buyer, supplier, order, and shipment actions with traceable evidence using mould setup card; polymeric footwear QCO checklist; component dispatch inspection; identifies buyer change, supplier delay, mould/spec mismatch, missing dispatch evidence, or order-document gap; records the evidence trail; and routes the case to polymeric footwear merchandiser, supplier coordinator, QA, or dispatch owner without claiming final approval, certification, audit, legal, buyer sign-off, or release authority. Workplace pressure: buyer response, supplier follow-up, order accuracy, and shipment cut-off timing, particularly when buyer change, supplier delay, mould/spec mismatch, missing dispatch evidence, or order-document gap; the wider environment also includes material-mix deviation, mould damage, curing-cycle variation, QCO nonconformance, batch holds, and dispatch deadlines.'),
