  ('23816f58-bf4f-5565-92ec-bbc7636e5a28', 'LFA-CAP-SUB003-BATCH', 2, 'Important', 'L5', 5, 'High conscientiousness, patience, practical problem solving, low impulsivity, and steady response to recurring process deviations. This profile is especially important under batch identity, mould or cycle deviations, production continuity, and dispatch readiness in polymeric footwear batch identity, mould defect, and production deviation control. Observable work demands: Confirms batch identity and process settings before interpreting a deviation using compound mixing sheet; mould setup card; curing or injection cycle log; identifies wrong batch identity, mould damage, curing deviation, cycle-setting error, or material mismatch; records the evidence trail; and routes the case to production supervisor, material owner, moulding supervisor, or QA without claiming final approval, certification, audit, legal, buyer sign-off, or release authority. Workplace pressure: batch identity, mould or cycle deviations, production continuity, and dispatch readiness, particularly when wrong batch identity, mould damage, curing deviation, cycle-setting error, or material mismatch; the wider environment also includes material-mix deviation, mould damage, curing-cycle variation, QCO nonconformance, batch holds, and dispatch deadlines.'),
