  ('0f6e56cd-8418-54e0-92b6-ed8e278c6a6d', 'LFA-CAP-SUB007-MERCH', 1, 'Core', 'L5', 5, 'High conscientiousness, moderate extraversion, collaborative agreeableness, steady emotional regulation, and openness to buyer or supplier feedback. This profile is especially important under buyer response, supplier follow-up, order accuracy, and shipment cut-off timing in footwear component buyer, supplier, bom, dispatch, and handoff coordination. Observable work demands: Closes buyer, supplier, order, and shipment actions with traceable evidence using component BOM; component dispatch inspection; upper stitching plan; identifies unclosed buyer comment, supplier delay, incorrect BOM, or dispatch label gap; records the evidence trail; and routes the case to component merchandiser, supplier coordinator, component QA, or dispatch owner without claiming final approval, certification, audit, legal, buyer sign-off, or release authority. Workplace pressure: buyer response, supplier follow-up, order accuracy, and shipment cut-off timing, particularly when unclosed buyer comment, supplier delay, incorrect BOM, or dispatch label gap; the wider environment also includes supplier mismatch, bonding or stitch failure, incorrect BOM or batch card, dispatch-label errors, and buyer handoff delays.'),
